EHOLDERS WILL OWN ABOUT 3% OF COMBINED COMPANY.CHEVRON CORP - TRANSACTION HAS BEEN UNANIMOUSLY APPROVED BY BOARDS OF DIRECTORS OF BOTH COMPANIES.CHEVRON CORP - ACQUISITION IS SUBJECT TO NOBLE ENERGY SHAREHOLDER APPROVAL.'}{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2020-07-20 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dollar Tree Says President & CEO Michael Witynski’S Annual Base Salary To Increase To $1.3 Million', 'text': 'DOLLAR TREE - IN CONNECTION WITH APPOINTMENT AS PRESIDENT & CEO MICHAEL WITYNSKI’S ANNUAL BASE SALARY TO INCREASE TO $1.3 MILLION - SEC FILING.DOLLAR TREE - MICHAEL WITYNSKI’S TARGET PAYOUT AMOUNT FOR ANNUAL INCENTIVE CASH BONUS TO INCREASE TO 150% OF BASE SALARY.DOLLAR TREE - WITYNSKI ALSO WILL RECEIVE SPECIAL EQUITY INCENTIVE AWARDS FOR 2020 FISCAL YEAR WITH AGGREGATE VALUE OF $2.6 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2020-07-20 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dollar Tree Says Michael Witynski Promoted To President And Chief Executive Officer', 'text': 'DOLLAR TREE ANNOUNCES PLANNED LEADERSHIP SUCCESSION.DOLLAR TREE INC - MICHAEL A. WITYNSKI PROMOTED TO PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.DOLLAR TREE INC - GARY PHILBIN ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT.DOLLAR TREE INC - PHILBIN WILL REMAIN WITH COMPANY AS AN EXECUTIVE AND MEMBER OF BOARD OF DIRECTORS THROUGH SEPTEMBER 23, 2020.DOLLAR TREE INC - MICHAEL WITYNSKI, ENTERPRISE PRESIDENT OF DOLLAR TREE, HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO PRESIDENT AND CEO.'}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2020-07-20 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Ebay's Management Of Payments Begins Scaling Globally", 'text': "EBAY'S MANAGEMENT OF PAYMENTS BEGINS SCALING GLOBALLY.EBAY INC - WILL BEGIN EXPANDING ITS MANAGEMENT OF PAYMENTS AROUND GLOBE.EBAY INC - 'THROUGH MANAGED PAYMENTS, EBAY IS ALSO ABLE TO PROVIDE BUYERS WITH MORE FLEXIBILITY AND CHOICE IN THEIR PAYMENT OPTIONS'.EBAY INC - APPLE PAY IS AVAILABLE AS A PAYMENT OPTION FOR BUYERS ON IPHONE AND IPAD.EBAY INC - GOOGLE PAY IS ALSO AVAILABLE FOR BUYERS ON EBAY SITE AND ON EBAY ANDROID APP.EBAY INC - MANAGED PAYMENTS PLATFORM EXPECTED TO 