R SCIENTIFIC - CO NOW SUPPORTING MORE THAN 200 COVID-19 PROJECTS GLOBALLY.THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC - ALSO EXPANDED CAPACITY FOR CUSTOMERS WHO ARE DEVELOPING NEW & EXISTING THERAPIES FOR COVID-19."}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2020-07-20 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Verizon Media Enables Grocery Shopping From Email', 'text': 'VERIZON MEDIA ENABLES GROCERY SHOPPING FROM EMAIL.VERIZON MEDIA - ANNOUNCED LAUNCH OF "GROCERIES FROM WALMART".VERIZON MEDIA - YAHOO MAIL USERS CAN NOW BROWSE, ADD TO CART, AND BUY ESSENTIAL GROCERIES FROM WALMART RIGHT WITHIN YAHOO MAIL.VERIZON MEDIA - GROCERIES FROM WALMART IS CURRENTLY AVAILABLE ON YAHOO MAIL IOS APP AND DESKTOP, WITH ANDROID COMING LATER THIS YEAR.'}{'symbol': 'VRTX', 'date': '2020-07-20 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Vertex Pharma Announces Positive Phase 3 Study Results For Trikafta', 'text': 'POSITIVE PHASE 3 STUDY RESULTS FOR TRIKAFTA® (ELEXACAFTOR/TEZACAFTOR/IVACAFTOR AND IVACAFTOR) IN PEOPLE AGES 12 AND OLDER WITH CYSTIC FIBROSIS WHO HAVE ONE COPY OF THE F508DEL MUTATION AND ONE GATING OR RESIDUAL FUNCTION MUTATION.VERTEX PHARMACEUTICALS INC - PHASE 3 STUDY MET PRIMARY ENDPOINT AND ALL SECONDARY ENDPOINTS.VERTEX PHARMACEUTICALS INC - STUDY IS A U.S. POST-MARKETING COMMITMENT AND WILL BE SUBMITTED TO FDA.VERTEX - DATA WILL BE SUBMITTED TO EMA TO SUPPORT INDICATION EXPANSION OF EU LABEL FOLLOWING TRIPLE COMBINATION APPROVAL.'}{'symbol': 'YUM', 'date': '2020-07-20 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'KFC Canada Says All Poutine, Chicken Bowls Will Be Served In Bamboo Buckets 2020 End', 'text': 'KFC CANADA - ALL POUTINE AND CHICKEN BOWLS WILL PERMANENTLY BE SERVED IN BAMBOO BUCKETS BY END OF 2020.'}